      "writtenOn": "2026-09-01T01:05:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It seems there are multiple documents about deps management:\n\n- https://crsrc.org/c/docs/build/gn_missing_dependencies.md\n- https://crsrc.org/c/agents/skills/gn-deps-debugging/SKILL.md\n- https://crsrc.org/c/agents/skills/gn-deps-debugging/references/dependency-patterns.md\n\nShould we add about fail-on-bad-deps there?\n\n@rysk@google.com do you have a recommendation on how we enable fail-on-bad-deps on agent and/or developer builds?",
      "parentUuid": "58a2041d_0c17a5a9",
      "range": {
